 ["R12","R","4.7k 0402","STRAP","UART0_RX","VDD3V3","The reference pulls RX up too (their R6). Populated."],
 ["R13","R","4.7k DNP","STRAP","SPI_MOSI","VDD3V3","EMMC_DAT0 (pin 22) pull-UP. Redundant with the SoC's internal pull-up, so unpopulated by default. Both straps left open selects the eMMC/SD0 controller, which is how you boot from the card."],
 ["R14","R","4.7k DNP","STRAP","SPI_WP","GND","EMMC_DAT3 (pin 23) pull-DOWN. Populate ONLY to boot from SPI NOR — the TRM requires DAT3 low and DAT0 high for NOR. Leave open for SD-card boot."],
